<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - South African company results consensus.</title>
<headline>TABLE - South African company results consensus.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts estimates of major South African company results expected next week include the following (all figures cents per share):</p>
<p>DAY--COMPANY------------PERIOD--CONSENSUS----RANGE---------PVS--</p>
<p>THU  LTA		    H1 EPS  108.3	  107.0-110.0   90.0</p>
<p>THU  LTA		    H1 DIV  24.0	   24.0	    20.0</p>
<p>NOTE:- Del Monte reports first half results on Wednesday but most analysts, while expecting a fall in earnings, declined to predict figures after the firm recently issued a profit warning.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
